BT 1 0 0 1 0 103.1 Tm .687956 Tw 14.2 TL 0 0 0 rg /F2+0 10.5 Tf 14.2 TL (This report works through six small systems that each depend on one idea from the CO2 syllabus: a hostel) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.851312 Tw (fee updater \(parameter passing, Q1\), an examination marks register \(return by reference, Q2\), a courier) Tj T* 0 Tw -0.050356 Tw (charge calculator \(default arguments and overloading, Q3\), a savings-account mini-statement \(a class with an) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.745248 Tw (array inside it, Q4\), a college bus ticket counter \(static members and arrays of objects, Q5\) and a train) Tj T* 0 Tw .925352 Tw (journey planner \(friend and inline functions, Q6\). For every question I followed the same routine: ) Tj /F3+0 10.5 Tf 14.2 TL (predict) Tj  T* 0 Tw .636957 Tw /F2+0 10.5 Tf 14.2 TL (first, ) Tj /F3+0 10.5 Tf 14.2 TL (implement) Tj /F2+0 10.5 Tf 14.2 TL (, ) Tj /F3+0 10.5 Tf 14.2 TL (execute) Tj /F2+0 10.5 Tf 14.2 TL ( with the compiler warnings switched on, ) Tj /F3+0 10.5 Tf 14.2 TL (compare) Tj /F2+0 10.5 Tf 14.2 TL ( the result with the prediction,) Tj T* 0 Tw .398568 Tw (and ) Tj /F3+0 10.5 Tf 14.2 TL (evaluate) Tj /F2+0 10.5 Tf 14.2 TL ( a design decision. Q7 then takes one of the six programs \(the Q4 account\), diagnoses where it) Tj T* 0 Tw (gets slow, redesigns it and checks the redesign against the original.) Tj T* ET
